  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mekong Australia Partnership Phase 1 - Human Capacity - Thailand</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment provides Short Term Awards (bilateral and regional) including masterclasses and dialogues for Thailand under the Mekong Australia Partnership (MAP) Phase 1 Building Human Capacity Pillar. The investment aims to support the following outcome: Mekong subregion countries demonstrate improved institutional and human capacity through delivery of education and knowledge transfer and building of enduring relationships that advance mutual interests.</narrative>
  </description>
